OL,3,GNEWSATraining cafe applies to extend
OL,4,Astay in city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA York community cafe that works with
OL,7,Fyoung people with disabilities and
OL,8,Fadditional needs is hoping to remain at
OL,9,Fits current site for a further five
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FHull Road Park Cafe, which is run by
OL,13,Fsocial enterprise Choose2 CIC, has
OL,14,Foperated from a portable cabin-style
OL,15,Fbuilding since 2017.
OL,17,FAn application to keep the Portakabin
OL,18,Fon site for the next five years has
OL,19,Fbeen submitted to City of York Council
OL,20,Fwhile funding for a permanent structure
OL,21,Fis sought.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
