OL,3,GNEWSATraining cafe applies to extend
OL,4,Astay in city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FChoose2 said the cafe had become an
OL,7,Fintegral part of the park and
OL,8,Fsurrounding area and that it wanted to
OL,9,Fcontinue to provide affordable food and
OL,10,Fdrink as well as offer skills
OL,11,Fdevelopment for its clients.
